# Compiler and Clippy before you finish

After changing Rust code, run both before you commit or open a pull request:

- `cargo check` so compiler warnings and errors are visible
- `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`

Fix every warning and error they report. Do not leave the change with a failing check or a denied Clippy lint. `cargo test` still runs as well when behavior changed.
